                    {
                        "form_id": "d96db8d9-97e5-40c4-9e2a-dbe1a8f57136",
                        "entry_id": "01164864-8f3c-3974-abc5-8f1a2571e696",
                        "tags": [
                            "adverbial",
                            "participle",
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "сги́нув"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f6544764-9172-48dc-b6f5-f83b43b8608b",
                        "entry_id": "01164864-8f3c-3974-abc5-8f1a2571e696",
                        "tags": [
                            "adverbial",
                            "participle",
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "сги́нувши"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0b03d698-68a8-31bc-914b-0f762ba48bee",
                        "entry_id": "01164864-8f3c-3974-abc5-8f1a2571e696",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. исчезнуть, пропасть (обычно бесследно, безвозвратно)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "da52bbc1-cf78-477d-b253-b7bc69043f26",
                                "sense_id": "0b03d698-68a8-31bc-914b-0f762ba48bee",
                                "text": "Что это вы с ним сделали? Свет ты мой, Иван Кузмич, удалая солдатская головушка! не тронули тебя ни штыки прусские, ни пули турецкие; не в честном бою положил ты свой живот, а сгинул от беглого каторжника!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e272df02-82cc-47e5-8430-9c35701649b1",
                                "sense_id": "0b03d698-68a8-31bc-914b-0f762ba48bee",
                                "text": "— Именем бога живого, — произнёс он, — если вы бесы, насланные вражьею силою, — сгиньте!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3ac52cc-7299-4ca1-9f6b-8cfd725f04bc",
                                "sense_id": "0b03d698-68a8-31bc-914b-0f762ba48bee",
                                "text": "Глядь! а ретуз-то и нету!. Я туда и сюда: сгинули!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b699c0af-7807-4299-a732-08b577b53317",
                                "sense_id": "0b03d698-68a8-31bc-914b-0f762ba48bee",
                                "text": "Нет-с; уж я лучше сгину, пропаду здесь на чужбине, заграницей, но в Россию, где женский вопрос, — не поеду."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "707ec68c-e19d-4068-9036-abdf453a984e",
                                "sense_id": "0b03d698-68a8-31bc-914b-0f762ba48bee",
                                "text": "— Пропал человек, сгинул… ровно камнем в воду…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d1afd75-8c5b-4ce0-8565-557a7a93567c",
                                "sense_id": "0b03d698-68a8-31bc-914b-0f762ba48bee",
                                "text": "Тут оба разбойника сгинули, а вместо них появилась в передней совершенно нагая девица — рыжая, с горящими фосфорическими глазами."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d247afd-5e41-4440-87b7-0ebcdf1a6881",
                        "source_entry_id": "01164864-8f3c-3974-abc5-8f1a2571e696",
                        "source_sense_id": "0b03d698-68a8-31bc-914b-0f762ba48bee",
                        "target_lang_word": "vanish",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vanish",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a96e732-833e-3a75-a838-79601fc0129f",
                                        "entry_id": "22a3482d-23a8-33a0-aecb-f048402302de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To become invisible or to move out of view unnoticed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f35399af-e3c2-4f4c-8ac9-5066d5e00273",
                                                "sense_id": "9a96e732-833e-3a75-a838-79601fc0129f",
                                                "text": "Holly, mistletoe, red berries, ivy, turkeys, geese, game, poultry, brawn, meat, pigs, sausages, oysters, pies, puddings, fruit, and punch, all vanished instantly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1da390b7-656d-498e-bea7-e7e1a8a197d1",
                                                "sense_id": "9a96e732-833e-3a75-a838-79601fc0129f",
                                                "text": "The Bat—they called him the Bat. Like a bat he chose the night hours for his work of rapine; like a bat he struck and vanished, pouncingly, noiselessly; like a bat he never showed himself to the face of the day."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6df2f1d-2d1f-40bd-9733-41653d20ceab",
                                                "sense_id": "9a96e732-833e-3a75-a838-79601fc0129f",
                                                "text": "I realize sometimes / In a web of passion we all get caught / But understand / All the hurt and all the pain / It's gonna vanish just like the rain"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a83158c3-23f4-3611-857f-732435b3b363",
                                        "entry_id": "22a3482d-23a8-33a0-aecb-f048402302de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To become equal to zero."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51528314-fc7e-4030-8571-605b093bdcf0",
                                                "sense_id": "a83158c3-23f4-3611-857f-732435b3b363",
                                                "text": "The function f such as f(x)#61;x² vanishes at x#61;0."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd8a0381-23d3-32f4-8d9e-ba84651b09da",
                                        "entry_id": "22a3482d-23a8-33a0-aecb-f048402302de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To disappear; to kidnap."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90b88873-7c7a-4720-b3a4-1b2fb0591b81",
                                                "sense_id": "fd8a0381-23d3-32f4-8d9e-ba84651b09da",
                                                "text": "And as if to prove it, one of his friends was vanished and was never seen again. The guy got in a taxi one night, and no one ever saw him ever again."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b02e06ed-837c-4844-a6fa-33984025649b",
                                                "sense_id": "fd8a0381-23d3-32f4-8d9e-ba84651b09da",
                                                "text": "It was whispered that men had been “vanished” by the Line and returned everted. Turned inside out."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "vanish",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "148c54fa-e0b1-36cc-91c1-6c4af0acef3c",
                                        "entry_id": "64424992-6930-3093-9483-c500b995e22e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The brief terminal part of a vowel or vocal element, differing more or less in quality from the main part."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a4cbd2f-74ce-4d8c-b032-6b3383f9f962",
                                                "sense_id": "148c54fa-e0b1-36cc-91c1-6c4af0acef3c",
                                                "text": "a as in ale ordinarily ends with a vanish of i as in ill."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97417689-5903-4887-8a51-9ffb4d1b88f0",
                                                "sense_id": "148c54fa-e0b1-36cc-91c1-6c4af0acef3c",
                                                "text": "o as in old ordinarily ends with a vanish of oo as in foot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b61ef4b8-853f-4fd6-b357-176ee347b940",
                                                "sense_id": "148c54fa-e0b1-36cc-91c1-6c4af0acef3c",
                                                "text": "The median stres may also on a protracted quantity , slightly resemble respectively that of the radical and of the vanish , by sudenly enlarging in the course of the prolongation and gradualy diminishing ; and by the reverse"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "852ffeec-201e-3358-9ce0-27cd275703eb",
                                        "entry_id": "64424992-6930-3093-9483-c500b995e22e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A magic trick in which something seems to disappear."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd3ddb7a-eb81-4ee8-956e-00b141b34e3f",
                                                "sense_id": "852ffeec-201e-3358-9ce0-27cd275703eb",
                                                "text": "The French drop is a well-known vanish involving sleight of hand."
                                            }
